        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A WONDERFUL 4 BED / 3 BATH SPACIOUS SEMI DETACHED FAMILY HOME PERFECTLY SITUATED IN A QUIET CUL DE SAC IN THE HIGHLY SOUGHT AFTER MATURE SETTLED NEIGHBOURHOOD OF SORREL IN CLONSILLA DUBLIN 15\r\n\r\nEARLY VIEWING IS HIGHLY ADVISED...\r\n\r\nMulti Award Winning Team Christina Wilson The Dublin 15 Property Specialists are delighted to present No. 26 Sorrel Dale to the Clonsilla property market. Sorrel is a extremely popular development of superior family homes tucked away in a secluded position. Every conceivable amenity is literally on your doorstep. \r\n\r\nA generous front driveway welcomes you to this superb family home. No. 26 will no doubt appeal to first time buyers, investors and those parties trading up / downsizing alike. This fine property has been tastefully decorated and very well maintained throughout. \r\n\r\nThe floor plan briefly consists of: Entrance hall, living / lounge room area, kitchen / dining room, utility room & guest wc. Upstairs there is a landing, 4 bedrooms to include master en suite, family bathroom and hot press. \r\n\r\nThis superb house is an excellent investment. The extremely spacious living / lounge room area features an ornate fireplace and top grade flooring. The bright and airy kitchen / dining room area boasts designer kitchen units. Ideally there is both an abundance of worktop space and extensive storage space. \r\n\r\nUpstairs there are four large double bedrooms each with fitted wardrobes. The beautiful master bedroom features an en-suite bathroom. The family bathroom has top quality sanitary ware. This premium property has top quality double glazing throughout and a gas fired heating system. \r\n\r\nThe large sunny back garden offers a perfect space to relax or entertain. \r\n\r\nThe location is second to none within a 25 minute drive of Dublin International Airport. Clonsilla and Blanchardstown Villages are all within close proximity. The Blanchardstown Shopping Centre is within easy reach. There are many recreational and sports amenities literally on your doorstep. Leisure activities including National Aquatic Centre and Sports Campus Ireland are in the Dublin 15 locality. Dublin 15's Corporate Parks and Connolly Hospital are also close by. The Phoenix Park and Castleknock Village are within a 15 minute drive. The property falls into an excellent catchment of both primary and secondary schools making it a real winner with families. The area is further serviced by an excellent bus service making the city most accessible. Also ideally the Clonsilla Train Station is only a 10 minute walk away this is connected to the Luas at the Broombridge Station. The M50 and M3 Motorways are also close to hand making this a most strategically positioned address. \r\n\r\nEarly viewing is strongly recommended…\r\n\r\n***All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have***"
      },
